# Cookie banner

Explain optional storage and let people make an informed choice before it is used.

## When to use

First establish what the application actually stores and why. Distinguish essential sign-in or security state from optional measurement. A banner cannot make an inaccurate description acceptable. Do not add an empty consent ritual to every local dashboard.

This documentation site has no analytics integration. The following examples illustrate a future service’s choice and confirmation; they do not set cookies or change Home Assistant’s storage.

